sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant E as ESTS (v2.0)
  participant B as User's browser<br/>(any device)
  C->>E: POST /{tenant|common}/oauth2/v2.0/devicecode
  Note over C,E: client_id, scope=openid profile offline_access + resource scopes
  E-->>C: 200 {device_code, user_code, verification_uri, expires_in,<br/>interval, message}
  C-->>B: show verification_uri and user_code to the user
  B->>E: user signs in and completes MFA in a browser
  loop poll
    Note over C,E: interval seconds (default 5), on slow_down add 5 seconds,<br/>stop on success, expiry or terminal error
    C->>E: POST /{tenant|common}/oauth2/v2.0/token
    Note over C,E: client_id, grant_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:device_code,<br/>device_code
    E-->>C: 400 {error: authorization_pending, error_codes: [70016]}
  end
  C->>E: POST /{tenant|common}/oauth2/v2.0/token (same request)
  E-->>C: 200 {access_token, refresh_token, id_token, expires_in (number),<br/>scope}
  Note over C,E: Validate the ID token and compare stable identity claims to the<br/>intended account
  opt details
    Note over C,E: redeem the refresh token for another resource
    C->>E: POST /{tenant}/oauth2/v2.0/token
    Note over C,E: client_id, grant_type=refresh_token, refresh_token,<br/>scope=...{resource}/.default, client_info=1
    E-->>C: 200 token response
  end
